        {
            "id": "20261126A072E400",
            "title": "骨健康的机会藏在哪？",
            "image": "https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/O3XRnV0ntq7gVeLhHVMb74TBTpXmJeX0rEAwKQY_5NmrAAA_870492/0",
            "link": "https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20261126A072E400",
            "author": "千锤百炼",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-26 11:08:27",
            "description": "<div class=\"rich_media_content\"><p>骨健康用药/保健品在全球范围内是一个“分散但巨大”的领域，市场规模400多亿美元，但没有单品进入全球畅销药前十。</p><p>从<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">MNC</span></span></span>在该领域的结构性布局看，安进一家公司靠三个骨相关产品（<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">Prolia</span></span></span>、<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">Evenity</span></span></span>、<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">Xgeva</span></span></span>）在2025年实现约86亿美元收入，其中<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">Evenity</span></span></span>同比增长34%、在美国<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">骨骼构建剂</span></span></span>市场份额超过60%。这说明骨健康的天花板不在“有没有患者”，而在“有没有能改变疾病进程的产品”。同时也须看清另一面：<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">Prolia</span></span></span>在2025年仅增长1%，安进已明确预计2026年因多个<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">生物类似药</span></span></span>在全球上市而加速下滑。</p><p>骨质疏松生物药已经进入类似药时代，这是国产替代的窗口，也或将是原研的黄昏。</p><p><strong>01</strong></p><p>全球VS中国市场格局差距大，</p><p>布局<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">氨糖类</span></span></span>产品风险高</p><p>中国骨关节炎药物市场（268亿元）相对全球（100亿美元）的占比，远高于中国医药市场整体的全球占比。原因有两个：一是患者基数；二是用药结构，中国大量使用<!-- -->中成药<!-- -->与<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">氨糖类</span></span></span>辅助用药，而欧美指南对这类产品的推荐等级持续下调（<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">OARSI</span></span></span>强烈不建议使用任何类型氨糖，<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">ACR</span></span></span> 2019年强烈建议不使用）。</p><p>这带来一个必须正视的判断：中国骨关节炎市场的“大”，有一部分是建立在指南推荐等级不高的产品上的。这类产品的政策风险不在注册端，而在<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">支付端</span></span></span>与<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">学术端</span></span></span>，一旦<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">集采</span></span></span>或指南进一步收紧，规模会快速收缩。<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">硫酸氨基葡萄糖</span></span></span>销售额从20亿元缩至6亿元，就是这个逻辑的预演。</p><p></p><div class=\"exeditor-image-card\" data-copyright=\"0\" data-qrcode=\"0\" data-source=\"custom\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OEz_HVC8A-5pZB58FcR2N-ttTq1pdC2Pi_dcQwAVvFvl8AA/641\" data-widget=\"image\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OEz_HVC8A-5pZB58FcR2N-ttTq1pdC2Pi_dcQwAVvFvl8AA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OEz_HVC8A-5pZB58FcR2N-ttTq1pdC2Pi_dcQwAVvFvl8AA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;width:100%;height:100%\"/></div><p></p><p>骨健康细分领域用药/保健品全球与中国对比</p><p>数据来源：公开信息整理</p><p><strong>02</strong></p><p>中外对照：骨健康</p><p>中国市场的重磅，为<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">渠道壁垒</span></span></span></p><p>中国市场的“重磅”不必是全球意义上的重磅，但往往是渠道意义上的重磅。一个终端20亿元的中成药贴膏，在全球排不上号，在中国足以支撑一家企业的转型。</p><p></p><div class=\"exeditor-image-card\" data-copyright=\"0\" data-qrcode=\"0\" data-source=\"custom\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/O6DU5VGK-fzzNGXyWT0BljnHkQfj-0tTGrHB4zvm6TP6kAA/641\" data-widget=\"image\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/O6DU5VGK-fzzNGXyWT0BljnHkQfj-0tTGrHB4zvm6TP6kAA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/O6DU5VGK-fzzNGXyWT0BljnHkQfj-0tTGrHB4zvm6TP6kAA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;width:100%;height:100%\"/></div><p></p><p>数据来源：公开信息整理</p><p><strong>03</strong></p><p>中国骨健康重磅产品建议标准</p><p>基于上述分析，笔者认为中国骨健康重磅产品需满足以下5项核心准入标准：</p><p></p><div class=\"exeditor-image-card\" data-copyright=\"0\" data-qrcode=\"0\" data-source=\"custom\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/O5n2a8omyq5uj5IEq2GwYoBVu0KxaIquLG2Ix3LH2fz0EAA/641\" data-widget=\"image\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/O5n2a8omyq5uj5IEq2GwYoBVu0KxaIquLG2Ix3LH2fz0EAA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/O5n2a8omyq5uj5IEq2GwYoBVu0KxaIquLG2Ix3LH2fz0EAA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;width:100%;height:100%\"/></div><p></p><p>数据来源：公开信息整理</p><p><strong>04</strong></p><p>骨健康领域市场洞察</p><p>聚焦未来五年的中国市场，基于终端规模超20亿元及5年以上<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">独占期</span></span></span>的双重标准进行梳理，骨健康领域有三类产品具备成为市场驱动力的潜力：</p><p></p><div class=\"exeditor-image-card\" data-copyright=\"0\" data-qrcode=\"0\" data-source=\"custom\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OBnlmFe_nwlJvDJNHvf2hAkUkwWWhCOSsYZEIUQB18RY8AA/641\" data-widget=\"image\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OBnlmFe_nwlJvDJNHvf2hAkUkwWWhCOSsYZEIUQB18RY8AA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OBnlmFe_nwlJvDJNHvf2hAkUkwWWhCOSsYZEIUQB18RY8AA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;width:100%;height:100%\"/></div><p></p><p>数据来源：公开信息整理</p><p>声明：本内容为作者独立观点，不代表药智网立场。如需转载，请务必注明文章作者和来源。</p></div>",
            "source": "qq",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-CN"
        },
