        {
            "id": "20261128A0CFB700",
            "title": "华夏理财天工34号的“过山车”：6个月最大回撤54%",
            "image": "",
            "link": "https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20261128A0CFB700",
            "author": "萌虎出山",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-28 18:03:08",
            "description": "<div class=\"rich_media_content\"><section>【华夏理财天工34号的“过山车”：6个月最大回撤54%】财联社11月28日电，成立时只募到120万元的银行理财，半年后存续规模冲上3615.94万元、扩张约30倍；随后其押中的赛道退潮，净值自高点回撤逾五成。这是一只名为“天工日开理财产品34号（存储芯片指数）A”理财成立以来的表现，属于华夏理财近年来打造的指数化理财名片——“天工指数”系列理财。根据查阅，截至2026年11月25日，该产品近6个月最大回撤达54.34%，单位净值从6月末的最高点1.9219回落至0.8775附近。而产品规模与净值的顶点几乎同时出现：规模在6月末冲上高点，净值也在6月末见顶回落。打破刚兑后的银行理财市场，破净已是常态，但超过50%的回撤并不常见。针对记者提出的大幅回撤后公司在投资端、风控等方面采取了哪些措施，以及对现存产品有无转型、改造或终止安排等问询，截至发稿，华夏理财尚未予以回应。（上证报）</section></div>",
            "source": "qq",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-CN"
        },
        {
            "id": "20261128A0CCZ400",
            "title": "光迅科技：境外控股子公司拟签不超3亿美元合作协议",
            "image": "https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/ObaUs7R4OPJWJJHbHbRaDF8b1wMD7es7x1G3PmmpUQWB4AA_870492/0",
            "link": "https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20261128A0CCZ400",
            "author": "繁星计划月度优质创作者",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-28 17:59:17",
            "description": "<div class=\"rich_media_content\"><p><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/news_bt/OmlsedKQn5ZUMFmRDnAAvblO-iuxIUP8V5gBD8dyJnsIgAA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/news_bt/OmlsedKQn5ZUMFmRDnAAvblO-iuxIUP8V5gBD8dyJnsIgAA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;display:block;max-width:100%;width:100%;height:100%\"/></p><p><strong><span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">雷达财经</span></span></span> 文|苏静 编|深海</strong></p><p>11月27日，<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">光迅科技</span></span></span>（002281）发布关于境外子公司拟签署合作协议的公告。公告显示，光迅科技<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">境外控股子公司</span></span></span><span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">ALMAE</span></span></span>（从事基于<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">磷化铟</span></span></span>材料的<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">光芯片</span></span></span>研发与制造）拟与某境外公司及其<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">关联方</span></span></span>（与公司无关联关系）签署合作协议。该协议已通过公司2026年11月27日召开的<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">第八届董事会第十二次会议</span></span></span>审议。</p><p>根据协议，ALMAE将向<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">交易对手方</span></span></span>许可6项<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">光芯片</span></span></span>专利及相关<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">专有技术</span></span></span>（全球范围），并提供法国生产基地3台<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">光芯片</span></span></span>工艺设备的十年租赁服务。交易金额由<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">初始对价</span></span></span>与<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">或有对价</span></span></span>构成，预计总金额不超过3亿美元，其中<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">初始对价</span></span></span>2.5亿美元，或有对价不超过5000万美元。</p><p>协议的顺利履行预计将对ALMAE财务状况及公司业绩产生积极影响，具体会计处理及<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">损益确认</span></span></span>金额以<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">年审会计师</span></span></span>审计结果为准。</p><p><span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">天眼查</span></span></span>资料显示，光迅科技全称为武汉光迅科技股份有限公司，成立于2001年01月22日，<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">注册资本</span></span></span>82784.8838万人民币，<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">法定代表人</span></span></span>黄宣泽，注册地址为武汉<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">东湖新技术开发区</span></span></span>流苏南路1号（<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">自贸区武汉片区</span></span></span>）。主营业务为光电子器件、模块产品的研发、生产及销售。</p><p>目前，公司董事长为黄宣泽，<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">董秘</span></span></span>为向明，最新年报显示员工人数为4945人，<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">实际控制人</span></span></span>为<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">中国信息通信科技集团有限公司</span></span></span>（持有武汉光迅科技股份有限公司股份比例：35.65%）。</p><p>公司<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">参股控股公司</span></span></span>12家，包括泛太科技有限公司、武汉电信器件有限公司、武汉光迅电子技术有限公司等。</p><p>在业绩方面，公司2023年、2024年、2025年营业收入分别为60.61亿、82.72亿和119.29亿，同比分别增长-12.31%、36.49%和44.20%；<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">归属净利润</span></span></span>分别为6.19亿、6.61亿和9.46亿，同比分别增长1.80%、6.82%和43.10%。同期，公司<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">资产负债率</span></span></span>分别为29.89%、38.07%和37.92%。</p><p>在风险方面，<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">天眼查</span></span></span>信息显示，公司自身<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">天眼风险</span></span></span>34条，周边<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">天眼风险</span></span></span>10条，历史<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">天眼风险</span></span></span>66条，预警提醒<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">天眼风险</span></span></span>217条。</p></div>",
            "source": "qq",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-CN"
        },
